{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43103","headline":"长安春赠友人 · 吴商浩","name":"长安春赠友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁华堪泣帝城春，粉堞青楼势碍云。\n花对玉钩帘外发，歌飘尘土路边闻。\n几多远客魂空断，何处王孙酒自醺。\n各有归程千万里，东风时节恨离羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴商浩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}